################################################################################
# PRODUCTION DATABASE HTTP SERVER ENGINE IN PURE BRAINFUCK                     #
# Language: Pure Brainfuck Standard Eight Instructions                         #
# Memory Model: 256 Cell Hardware Mapped Tape with Direct MMIO Registers       #
################################################################################

# MEMORY TAPE ALLOCATION MAP:
#   Cell 0       : Request Method ASCII Character (G=71 P=80 D=68)
#   Cell 2       : Request URI Path Length in Bytes
#   Cell 3       : HTTP Keep Alive Flag (1=KeepAlive 0=Close)
#   Cell 4       : Authorization Header Present Flag (1=Present 0=Absent)
#   Cell 5       : Request Body Byte Length
#   Cell 7       : MMIO System Hardware Port (1=Trigger Health Check)
#   Cell 8       : MMIO Crypto Hardware Port (1=Trigger JWT Verification)
#   Cell 9       : MMIO Crypto Status Port (0=Valid 1=InvalidSig 2=BadPayload)
#   Cell 16      : MMIO Database Hardware Port (1=Feed 2=Post 3=Insert 4=Like 5=Unlike)
#   Cell 17      : MMIO Post ID Integer Register (Accumulated Decimal Value)
#   Cell 32      : MMIO Network Hardware Port (1=Strobe Transmit Response)
#   Cell 33      : MMIO HTTP Status Code (200 201 400 401 404)
#   Cell 34      : MMIO Response Template Type (0=DB 1=404 2=BadID 3=NoTok 4=BadTok 5=BadPay 6=NoBody)
#   Cells 48 to 56 : Brainfuck Scratchpad Registers (Flags Mismatch Scratch Temps)
#   Cells 64 to 95 : Request URI Path Buffer (ASCII Character Array)


################################################################################
# Initialization
################################################################################
#   Initialize handled register to zero
#   Cell 51 stores whether current request has been processed

    >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
    >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>[-]

