################################################################################
# Route 3: POST /posts
################################################################################
#   Route check for POST slash posts
#   Compare method against ASCII P 80
#   Compare path characters slash p o s t s and null terminator
#   Validate authorization token presence
#   If token missing: return 401 with missing bearer token error
#   If token present: invoke crypto coprocessor MMIO to verify JWT
#   Check crypto status: if valid then validate body length
#   If body length is zero: return 400 with body required error
#   If body length is non zero: trigger DB insert post and return 201
#   If crypto status is 2: return 401 with invalid token payload error
#   If crypto status is 1: return 401 with invalid or expired token error

